{"id": "section-body-04548", "title": "Venom Ophthalmia", "chapterId": "chapter-four", "tocLevel": 4, "tocPath": ["APPROACH TO PATIENTS WITH EMERGENCY CONDITIONS", "NOTIFIABLE DISEASES", "Protozoa and Others", "Venom Ophthalmia"], "blocks": [{"id": "body-04548", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Venom Ophthalmia", "runs": [{"text": "Venom"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Ophthalmia"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 3, "numberingId": "1760"}}, {"id": "body-04549", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Spitting Cobras, like the Black-necked Spitting Cobra, the Ashe’s Spitting Cobra and the Red Spitting Cobra can spit the venom into the eyes or onto the skin of a patient. Venom on intact skin can just be washed with water. Venom which was spilt into the eyes of a patient can cause severe complications including blindness.", "runs": [{"text": "Spitting Cobras, like the Black-necked Spitting Cobra, the Ashe’s Spitting Cobra and the Red Spitting Cobra can spit the venom"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "into"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "eyes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "onto"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "a"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "patient."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Venom"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "on"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "intact"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "skin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "can"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "just"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "washed"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "water."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Venom"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "which"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "was"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "spilt into the eyes of a patient can cause severe complications including blindness."}]}, {"id": "body-04551", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Clinical Presentation", "runs": [{"text": "Clinical"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Presentation"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-04552", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Symptoms of venom ophthalmia include: Photophobia, Burning, Watering, Redness, Extreme Pain, Blurred Vision or Blindness.", "runs": [{"text": "Symptoms of venom ophthalmia include: Photophobia, Burning, Watering, Redness, Extreme Pain, Blurred Vision or "}, {"text": "Blindness."}]}, {"id": "body-04554", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Non-Pharmacological Management", "runs": [{"text": "Non-Pharmacological"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Management"}], "level": 4}, {"id": "body-04555", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "The victim should be advised not to rub their eyes.", "runs": [{"text": "The"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "victim"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "advised"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "not"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "rub"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "their"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "eyes."}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "1760"}}, {"id": "body-04556", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Victim should be advised to wash the eyes with clean water.", "runs": [{"text": "Victim"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "should"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "be"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "advised"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "wash"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "eyes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "with"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "clean"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "water."}], "list": {"level": 4, "numberingId": "1760"}}, {"id": "body-04557", "type": "paragraph", "style": "ListParagraph", "text": "Ensure the venom doesn’t enter the mouth of the victim.", "runs": [{"text": "Ensure"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "venom"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "doesn’t"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "enter"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"tex